                  "reading": "The author modified a component, `<CartSummary />`, that now:\n\n- runs `clear` when a shopper clicks \"Empty the cart\", where the `onClick` ran `() => setIsConfirming(true)` before\n- declares no state and no handler of its own: `isConfirming` and `handleConfirm()` are removed\n- renders no `<Dialog>`, so the title \"Empty the cart?\" and the \"Empty it\" button are removed with it\n\n[`clear` sets `items` to `[]`](code:src/stores/cart-store.ts#L19-21), so that one click empties the cart and [`<CartPage />` then returns \"Your cart is empty.\"](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L7). `<Button>` passes `onClick` to its `<button>`, so `clear` now receives the click event, and [`clear` reads no argument](code:src/stores/cart-store.ts#L19-21).",
